+- Use gpt-image-2 through the built-in image generation workflow.
+- Create one 1600 x 900 PNG.
+- Show a split composition divided by one simple vertical black line.
+- Left half: one pale cream rounded card lying flat, tilted, drooping, wilted, and slightly faded.
+- Right half: one upright bright yellow rounded card with a clean black check mark.
+- Below the right card: one doodle trouser pocket with blank money-green bank-note bills tucked into it.
+- Keep clean cornflower blue space at the top on both halves for code-rendered overlays.
+- Use thick wobbly black outlines, rounded simple shapes, flat fills only, and the locked course palette with money-green only on the bills.
+- Avoid people, faces, text, words, letters, numbers, dollar signs, labels, ambient doodles, motion marks, icons, random props, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective depth.
+
+## Verification
+
+- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
+- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
+- Visually inspect for the exact split composition, open top blue space, blank green bills, no people, no text, no symbols beyond the requested check mark, and no decorative clutter.

