course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b02_three-blocks.png.log:15:Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b02_three-blocks.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references and cast-board character style exactly. COMPOSITION: Three large rounded doodle building blocks being stacked into a single tidy tower, center frame on plain cornflower blue. The bottom block is cream, the middle block is yellow, the top block is orange. Simple, friendly, geometric. No people. Generous clean blue space above and on both sides for overlaid code text. STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills only in the locked palette: cornflower-blue #62b3f3 background, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black. No gradients, no texture, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, small subtle curved cast-board nose, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, motion marks, icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No text, letters, words, numbers, symbols, dollar signs, labels, captions, screens with writing, or readable paperwork anywhere. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG.
