course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b10_comp-sheet.png.log:15:Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b10_comp-sheet.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached style references and cast-board character style exactly. COMPOSITION: Two overlapping doodle paper documents center-frame on plain cornflower blue: the back sheet cream, the front sheet white with a yellow header band and a few plain horizontal black line strokes suggesting unreadable text lines (no actual letters, numbers, or symbols). A simple orange seal circle sits at the bottom corner of the front sheet. Conveys: your official offer letter and comp sheet. No people. Generous clean blue space above for overlaid code text. STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills only in the locked palette: cornflower-blue #62b3f3 background, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black. No gradients, no texture, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, small subtle curved cast-board nose, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, motion marks, icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No text, letters, words, numbers, symbols, dollar signs, labels, captions, screens with writing, or readable paperwork anywhere. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG.
docs/course-production/remotion/src/Lesson8A.tsx:40:const BLUE = '#62b3f3';
docs/course-production/STYLE-BLOCK.md:1:Use a flat hand drawn sticker sheet illustration style on a bright cornflower blue background, with simple objects floating in active negative space rather than forming a realistic scene. Draw every shape with thick rounded black outlines, slightly uneven pressure, visible wobble, and imperfect curves; keep line weight bold and consistent. Use flat fills only: cornflower blue, sunflower yellow, golden yellow, tangerine orange, pale cream, warm white, black, small touches of peach skin tone and light gray hair. Characters are small, friendly, and simplified, with dot eyes, tiny noses (a small subtle curved hook/comma line, exactly like the cast board — NOT large, pointed, or bracket-shaped), minimal mouths, round heads, chunky hair silhouettes, cylindrical arms and legs, oversized shoes, and squat proportions; identity comes from pose, hair, outfit color, and one clear prop. Detail is icon level: strong silhouettes, a few interior marks, no rendering. Add balanced doodles like puffy clouds, sparkle stars, speech bubbles with dots, music notes, hearts, grass tufts, motion ticks, signs, mugs, folders, keys, plants, and simple tools. Avoid realism, thin lines, gradients, shadows, perspective depth, texture, airbrush lighting, crowded scenes, tiny unreadable details, and polished vector perfection.
docs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_17.sh:25:STYLE='STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills only in the locked palette: cornflower-blue #62b3f3 background, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black. No gradients, no texture, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, small subtle curved cast-board nose, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, motion marks, icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No text, letters, words, numbers, symbols, dollar signs, labels, captions, screens with writing, or readable paperwork anywhere. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG.'
docs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_17.sh:27:STYLEG='STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills — palette is yellow, orange, cream, white, black on cornflower-blue #62b3f3, PLUS money-green used ONLY for cash / bank-notes (an intentional communication exception so money reads as money). No gradients, no texture, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, small subtle curved cast-board nose, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, motion marks, icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No text, letters, words, numbers, symbols, dollar signs, labels, captions, screens with writing, or readable paperwork anywhere. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG.'
