course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b08_funnel.png.log:1971:docs/course-production/NEXT-SESSION.md:10:- **v1→v2 delta (still in v3):** each seller SETUP shows a full situational scene still (identity-matched to portrait) with a push-in instead of a plain portrait; Carol's TAG (b05) is a **looping Seedance animation of Carol arguing with the contractor** (both angry) — other tags stay portraits; Ray (b04) has no tag. Scenes: David flat rental+PAST DUE · Beth living room + elderly mother's memorial photo (Beth stays 40s) · Ray kitchen+letter · Carol door+LIEN+abandoned repair · Marcus driveway+multi-story dream house. Code: `scripts/build_manifest_2B.py` (scene + `TAGCLIPS` + `rekey_anim` + tagClip/tagClipFrames/tagHold + hasTag) and `remotion/src/Lesson2B.tsx` SellerBeat (scene→avatar→portrait; Carol tagClip loops via same-frame clamp). Render via ISOLATED root `npx remotion render src/index2b.ts Lesson2B` (shared Root.tsx still broken by 3B's `Lesson3B` export rename — unfixed). QC pass: blue #62b3f3, BMH badge b01, audio −20.4 dB, no clones.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b08_funnel.png.log:1972:docs/course-production/NEXT-SESSION.md:27:- **Module 06 / Lesson 6B "The Handoff" (Slot 08 pt 2)**: THIS session (2026-07-07) — locked master Slot 08 cues 9–16, ~600 words / ~5 min, ONE lesson NO split, 8 beats. 6A (cues 1–8) is done; this is the sibling half. Zero master deviations (100% verbatim, incl. cue 16 closing line). **Storyboard APPROVED by Jarrad (2026-07-07)** — see `shotlists/module-06-lesson6B-scenecards.md` for the full 8-beat card set. **Bookend avatar override: 1A solo-Andrea portrait avatar (`e527528e584a404f9da68ee4faca1353`)**, NOT cafe-Andrea — color-match requirement: Andrea's backing must be sampled/matched to canonical `#62b3f3` exactly (see scene-card doc for the fix + QC method; do not reuse 3B's/5A's inset/backing values as-is). b02 CRM-notes beat = BMH rep (Priya) typing at a computer, not a bare screen. BMH badge b01, 1.0s gaps, on-screen text code-rendered via Sticker, Seedance candidates on b02/b03 (static fallback if Higgsfield down). NEXT: Stage 2 audio (HeyGen `/v3/voices/speech` decoupled pipeline, speed 1.0, word timestamps) → Stage 3 stills (5 new: crmnotes/briefam/transfer/checklist/killers; b01/b08 reuse the bookend still but need a new talking clip) → per-still gate. **Owns ONLY `*lesson6B*` / `module-06-lesson6B` paths** (does NOT touch 6A's `module-06`): `shotlists/module-06-lesson6B-*`, `shotlists/lesson-6B-*`, `remotion/src/Lesson6B.tsx`(+isolated entry), `remotion/public/lesson6B/`, `course-assets/scenes/module-06-lesson6B/`, `course-assets/heygen/lesson6B/`, `review-lesson6B/`, `scripts/*_6B.*`. IN PRODUCTION.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b08_funnel.png.log:1973:docs/course-production/NEXT-SESSION.md:31:  - **KEY LEARNINGS (avoid repeating the v3→v11 saga):** (1) HeyGen 1A headset avatar renders on a near-WHITE studio bg → keying white ATE Andrea's white face (smurf). FIX: pass `"background":{"type":"color","value":"#62b3f3"}` in `/v3/videos` so she renders on cornflower blue, then key the blue (Andrea has no blue) → composite on code `#62b3f3`. (2) The avatar's own panel blue ≠ the bg-fill blue → two blues; keying the blue unifies them. (3) **QC the FAR background (away from the silhouette), not near her edges** — edge anti-alias fringe falsely reads as "not uniform." (4) Never claim "fixed" off 2 pixel samples — scan the far-bg of the DELIVERED file. (5) Isolated splice works for single-beat swaps (render one beat's frame range → ffmpeg trim+concat onto the prior render) but NOT for structural changes (beat merge/count change → full render). (6) Merged-beat intro = concat wavs + one HeyGen clip, remove the 2nd beat from BEATS.
