docs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_18B.sh:57:    gen "m18_L18B_b04_quality-check.png" "Quality-check scene on a plain cornflower-blue field, leaving a clear empty circular pocket in the lower-right corner for Andrea's later corner-circle overlay. LEFT/CENTER: one BMH follow-up representative with headset and one manager stand beside a large blank outbound-message card on a simple review table. The manager points gently at the blank card; the rep listens. Above or beside the card are three small blank callout shapes with no writing. Exactly two people total, no clones. The mood is professional review, not scolding. Keep bottom-right open and uncluttered." ;;
